# aiolyric

Python package for the Honeywell Lyric Platform.

## Releases

aiolyric is released to PyPI with each GitHub release, using the release tag as
the version.

## Attributions / Contributions

- [@bramkragten](https://github.com/bramkragten) for the original
  implementation. Referenced his
  [package](https://github.com/bramkragten/python-lyric) quite a bit whilst
  writing this one.
- [@ludeeus](https://github.com/ludeeus) for his generator class. Made reading
  json into objects super simple. :tada:
- [Everyone else](https://github.com/timmo001/aiolyric/graphs/contributors).
  Thanks for the help!
